        "name": "avg_npc_1008_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Found it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agitated Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1011_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Found it, found it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dozy Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Found it when the fowlbeast was singing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dozy Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1008_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How's the weather today?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agitated Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1011_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "All good until the bad happens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dozy Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1008_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Time is of the essence. Our party is about to begin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agitated Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Baa, why did you only arrive just now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agitated Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#4$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1008_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say no more. I can tell at a glance that you're different from the other mediocre people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agitated Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suggest you join our grand plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agitated Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#4$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grand plan? What are you going to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#2$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where am I... And why am I wearing Mutti's clothes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1008_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will find what we like most, carry it on our backs, and never take it off again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agitated Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1011_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is so very heavy, so heavy that I won't be able to straighten my back, but it is very important!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dozy Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1008_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you have nothing on your back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agitated Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1011_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, she does have it on her back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dozy Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1",
