    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "-150,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good evening, child. Did you hear the bell?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#2$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bell? No... But that might be because I can't hear very well most of the time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, you should also come and join our party.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#4$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "When next the bell rings, at the end of the world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "But before that, I have something to show you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
