    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmhmm. It looks like my memory is correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "These stones, specimens, and red-colored photos. These are what you've been brought here to see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The gentle creature walks forward with light footsteps."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, these rocks have been alive for thousands, tens of thousands of years. They were buried here, deep beneath the ground, long before even we were here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "They are so beautiful, so passionate. Though they were deep underground, hundreds of miles apart, they eventually came together and brought forth a marvelous eruption.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "You love them, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Volcanoes? I do...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Volcanoes or rocks, they are all very precious treasures.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, my dear Adele...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if someone used them to do bad things? What would you do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#2$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bad things? Like what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
