    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.8
    },
    {
        "text": "The North Wind we've found, we've found \u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Agitated Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1011_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "900,0",
        "posto": "900,0",
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "action": "jump",
        "posto": "-900,0",
        "power": 50,
        "times": 3,
        "duration": 3,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But where are the seeds in the ground, the ground \u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dozy Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, the party's about to begin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Adele, would you like to bring a rock to the party?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, let us make haste.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
