    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#2$2",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong? What's on your mind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... I'm sorry to say this, but I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#2$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Little Black Sheep... Are you Mr. Dolly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am Dolly, but I am also not Dolly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who I am depends on what I am in your mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are some differences between you and Mr. Dolly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are all of those... Little Black Sheep?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no. We cannot say 'all.' Each and every one is unique, as is their connection to the world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just as we refer to you, we would not call all of them 'Adele.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every 'Adele' is unique.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#2$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#11$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, why did you invite me here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because of the North Wind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because we wished to share the joys of harvest. Every participant in this party has been chosen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Including you, my dear Adele.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "The things I've experienced the last few days have truly been mind-boggling.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That, too, is a part of life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you happy right now, little one?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me take a look. I believe you are...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "...not very happy right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look over there. She is the proof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1004_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Little Black Sheep look down from atop the chest."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "jump",
        "power": 3,
        "times": 1,
