        "power": 5,
        "times": 1,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "A tiny, fragile creature tries to jump up \u2013 once, twice... Try as it might, it cannot jump onto the chest."
    },
    {
        "text": "Hrmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tiny Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#4$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it alone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She looks very weak right now. Too weak to jump.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#2$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we help her out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only when the volcano erupts will she become herself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1016_agoat2_1#2$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is she also one of your kind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1007_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Eventually, everyone will become one of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gentle Creature"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
