        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mornin', Adele. Would you like some breakfast?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you look so tired? Want me to make you a cup of coffee?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good morning...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "text": "I seem to have had a really long and strange dream last night, and I'm still a bit out of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4106_bryota_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know what they say around here? The emotions that overflow too much during the day are left over for you to savor in your dreams at night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_180_amgoat_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was the dream about again? I seem to remember something about it being very noisy and lively...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_180_amgoat_1#9$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "It's true! I really saw it all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_992_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_994_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, yes. I believe you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harley"
    },
    {
        "text": "And because of that, you're not allowed to have ice cream for two months for sneaking out of your room and midnight and sneaking over to the land by the sea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_992_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aww...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ice Cream-Craving Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I saw a little lamb run into my room last night, and it took me to a place where there were a whole bunch of other lambs...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indignant Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "There were a whole bunch of lambs, as fluffy as marshmallows, singing and dancing on top of a chest...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indignant Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_994_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If what you say is true, a flock of sheep invited you to join their midnight party.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_992_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, I think that makes sense. Because I've been a good girl...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indignant Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
